ny kind of items and automatically generate its cells from these items. The section"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also able to handle all end-user interaction with the generated cells, including adding,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing, deleting, and moving the cells. When cells are added or edited, detail views are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"automatically generated for this purpose. To enable adding cells, the class’ user should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set the addButtonItem property of the section to a valid UIBarButtonItem, the section then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will automatically add new items when the button is tapped."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"SCArrayOfItemsSection","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SCArrayOfItemsSection"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfItemsSection/mutableItems":{"abstract":[{"text":"Used internally by the framework.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"mutableItems","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection\/mutableitems","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mutableItems","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection\/mutableItems","type":"topic"}}}